WEBVTT

00:00:45.359 --> 00:00:49.071
PERFECT CROWN

00:00:59.956 --> 00:01:01.165
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION

00:01:01.166 --> 00:01:03.167
CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS WERE FILMED SAFELY

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:18.225
The unyielding throne of Joseon

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:21.603
stood firm for 600 years…

00:01:31.196 --> 00:01:33.323
before fading under the constitutional monarchy.

00:01:35.659 --> 00:01:38.161
Though its prestige endured, it became largely ceremonial.

00:01:41.248 --> 00:01:42.416
Power became class.

00:01:44.459 --> 00:01:45.752
Class became hereditary.

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:48.338
And it held on…

00:01:50.298 --> 00:01:51.383
tenaciously.

00:01:58.723 --> 00:01:59.974
Make way, make way.

00:01:59.975 --> 00:02:00.976
I said, move.

00:02:01.726 --> 00:02:03.269
2009 ROYAL ACADEMY SPRING EXAM RANKING

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:05.187
SEONG HUIJU, JUJAK HOUSE

00:02:05.188 --> 00:02:08.024
SECOND-PLACE LAUREATE: RYU MINSEOK, CHEONGNYONG HOUSE

00:02:08.608 --> 00:02:10.318
It's that brat again?

00:02:29.087 --> 00:02:30.380
You said you'd win.

00:02:31.965 --> 00:02:33.341
And yet you lost again.

00:02:36.386 --> 00:02:38.513
Only fools flail desperately over trifles.

00:02:39.473 --> 00:02:40.931
Aren't you exhausted yet?

00:02:40.932 --> 00:02:41.933
Hmm?

00:02:42.642 --> 00:02:43.769
Was it hard for you?

00:02:44.644 --> 00:02:47.772
I didn't find this exam difficult at all.

00:02:49.274 --> 00:02:51.610
You've lost. Learn to accept defeat.

00:02:52.861 --> 00:02:54.738
Don't run your mouth and embarrass yourself.

00:02:55.238 --> 00:02:56.781
You're not even a noble.

00:02:56.782 --> 00:02:58.282
Know your place.

00:02:58.283 --> 00:03:00.243
Watch your mouth, you noble prick.

00:03:02.037 --> 00:03:03.538
Do you want to be written up?

00:03:04.873 --> 00:03:05.874
Damn it.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.835
You should put some effort into it next time, Minseok.

00:03:09.628 --> 00:03:10.711
Okay?

00:03:10.712 --> 00:03:12.838
How is it you lose every single time?

00:03:12.839 --> 00:03:14.841
You're an esteemed nobleman, after all.

00:03:16.551 --> 00:03:18.136
Just look at this mess of a uniform.

00:03:25.894 --> 00:03:28.395
Is Huiju the top laureate for the ninth grade again?

00:03:31.441 --> 00:03:32.484
Yes, sir.

00:03:33.693 --> 00:03:36.238
The morale in Jujak House must be through the roof.

00:03:36.947 --> 00:03:40.200
Everyone's spirits are high.

00:03:41.952 --> 00:03:42.994
Seong Huiju.

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:45.997
- Yes? - Are you aware of our founding philosophy?

00:03:47.582 --> 00:03:50.252
- Pardon? - Why the Crown established this school.

00:03:51.586 --> 00:03:52.587
Well…

00:03:53.922 --> 00:03:55.881
Equal opportunity and…

00:03:55.882 --> 00:03:59.010
That's right. Equal opportunity was very much the objective.

00:03:59.636 --> 00:04:01.345
Seonggyungwan is great and all,

00:04:01.346 --> 00:04:04.015
but limiting admission to noblemen's sons has obvious limits.

00:04:08.144 --> 00:04:09.187
Right.

00:04:10.981 --> 00:04:12.816
Do you know who invented this?

00:04:17.487 --> 00:04:18.737
That's right. :cue

00:04:18.738 --> 00:04:21.156
A masterpiece of its era, commissioned by King Sejong

00:04:21.157 --> 00:04:22.534
and crafted by Jang Yeongsil.

00:04:23.535 --> 00:04:25.120
Isn't it?

00:04:26.121 --> 00:04:28.123
He may have been the son of a courtesan,

00:04:29.124 --> 00:04:30.709
but he had a brilliant mind.

00:04:36.506 --> 00:04:38.258
Here. Take this.

00:05:03.283 --> 00:05:08.705
PERFECT CROWN

00:05:09.414 --> 00:05:10.581
EPISODE 1

00:05:10.582 --> 00:05:12.125
You said we'd win,

00:05:13.877 --> 00:05:15.044
but we lost.

00:05:15.045 --> 00:05:16.670
Lost?

00:05:16.671 --> 00:05:18.589
We remain the industry leader,

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:21.134
and we also ranked first in the preference survey.

00:05:22.636 --> 00:05:25.721
You know how underhanded their promotional tactics can be.

00:05:25.722 --> 00:05:27.974
They're offering 50% off as part of their launch event.

00:05:28.475 --> 00:05:30.643
And you know Lee Yungyeong, who made a comeback?

00:05:30.644 --> 00:05:33.729
They managed to create some buzz with that celebrity endorsement.

00:05:36.483 --> 00:05:37.650
So,

00:05:37.651 --> 00:05:39.486
you're confirming we lost

00:05:40.236 --> 00:05:41.237
in terms of sales.

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:43.614
My apologies, ma'am.

00:05:43.615 --> 00:05:44.990
Let's start digging.

00:05:44.991 --> 00:05:46.909
Who shall we dig into exactly?

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:49.620
Don't tell me you want us to dig into their CEO.

00:05:49.621 --> 00:05:50.788
That's asking for trouble.

00:05:50.789 --> 00:05:53.624
That would be a complete waste of time.

00:05:53.625 --> 00:05:55.042
Of course.

00:05:56.169 --> 00:05:58.546
Lee Yungyeong turned us down and became their spokesperson.

00:05:59.756 --> 00:06:01.215
Dig into her.

00:06:01.216 --> 00:06:02.424
Understood. Pardon?

00:06:02.425 --> 00:06:05.761
When a single ad blows up like this, there are bound to be issues.

00:06:05.762 --> 00:06:08.932
Where there are issues, trouble follows.

00:06:10.016 --> 00:06:13.269
It shouldn't be too difficult to spin them into a full-blown media storm.

00:06:14.312 --> 00:06:16.897
No… …it shouldn't be difficult, but…

00:06:16.898 --> 00:06:18.775
If it's not difficult, then do it.

00:06:19.359 --> 00:06:22.570
Play dirty and cheap.

00:06:23.279 --> 00:06:25.031
- Yes, ma'am. - Logistics.

00:06:26.491 --> 00:06:27.700
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:27.701 --> 00:06:29.493
I'm the logistics manager.

00:06:29.494 --> 00:06:30.495
What?

00:06:31.579 --> 00:06:32.998
You two could be twins.

00:06:35.875 --> 00:06:38.086
Anyhow, let's cut outbound volume.

00:06:38.837 --> 00:06:40.754
- By half. - That much?

00:06:40.755 --> 00:06:44.425
Spark fear of missing out in consumers and push the products to sell out.

00:06:44.426 --> 00:06:45.592
Make it go viral.

00:06:45.593 --> 00:06:47.177
As quickly and loudly as possible.

00:06:47.178 --> 00:06:48.971
- Yes, ma'am. - Wait, hold on.

00:06:48.972 --> 00:06:53.100
That's not as easy as it sounds. The units have already been produced.

00:06:53.101 --> 00:06:54.643
- Toss them. - Pardon?

00:06:54.644 --> 00:06:57.147
Bury them or burn them.

00:06:58.148 --> 00:07:00.441
The possibilities are endless.

00:07:00.442 --> 00:07:02.693
But we'd take a huge loss…

00:07:02.694 --> 00:07:04.696
Gosh, look at our logistics manager.

00:07:05.572 --> 00:07:09.033
Sounds like you save every penny just to pinch it harder.

00:07:12.912 --> 00:07:14.330
Yeah. My goodness.

00:07:15.081 --> 00:07:18.168
I hope all that saving makes you ridiculously rich.

00:07:19.085 --> 00:07:20.502
I will decide

00:07:20.503 --> 00:07:23.548
what I do with my money.

00:07:28.887 --> 00:07:31.680
- Whose phone is that? - Unbelievable.

00:07:31.681 --> 00:07:33.182
That's five minutes. We're done.

00:07:33.183 --> 00:07:34.850
Hold on. We have one more item.

00:07:34.851 --> 00:07:37.936
Traffic downtown is already nuts. You don't want to be late.

00:07:37.937 --> 00:07:40.189
I get it!

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:43.026
Why did His Majesty have to be born today of all days?

00:07:46.279 --> 00:07:48.280
You all know I'll be at the palace today.

00:07:48.281 --> 00:07:52.160
I'll be drumming up some serious buzz for us.

00:07:52.744 --> 00:07:54.120
So I expect all of you

00:07:54.954 --> 00:07:55.955
to work just as hard.

00:07:56.873 --> 00:07:59.083
- Yes, ma'am. - Of course.

00:07:59.834 --> 00:08:01.168
What exactly should we--

00:08:01.169 --> 00:08:03.545
Write up articles. Articles.

00:08:03.546 --> 00:08:05.130
- Articles. -  Yes. Articles.

00:08:05.131 --> 00:08:06.507
Articles…

00:08:06.508 --> 00:08:10.720
"Castle Group successor gets invited to His Majesty's Royal Birthday Banquet."

00:08:12.722 --> 00:08:14.431
Killer headline, don't you think?

00:08:14.432 --> 00:08:15.808
You're the successor now?

00:08:15.809 --> 00:08:17.810
- No. - Then why did you lie?

00:08:17.811 --> 00:08:21.772
The ones who claim they're all that rarely are.

00:08:21.773 --> 00:08:24.275
They all say it, hoping to will it into existence.

00:08:25.735 --> 00:08:27.153
Do you know nothing about PR? :cue

00:08:53.012 --> 00:08:55.430
THE ROYAL FAMILY GATHERS FOR THE KING'S ROYAL BIRTHDAY

00:08:55.431 --> 00:08:57.766
…PREPARES FOR A ROYAL CELEBRATION…

00:08:57.767 --> 00:08:59.811
ROYAL BIRTHDAY BANQUET AT GYEONGBOKGUNG PALACE…

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:27.088
Your Royal Highness, you must make haste.

00:09:32.594 --> 00:09:34.262
- Your Royal Highness! -  Excuse me.

00:09:42.854 --> 00:09:44.939
I'll handle it from here. You all can go.

00:09:47.984 --> 00:09:50.445
Your Royal Highness, it is Hyeon.

00:09:51.446 --> 00:09:52.572
Come in.

00:10:26.356 --> 00:10:27.357
Your Royal Highness.

00:10:27.899 --> 00:10:29.525
Have you prepared a gift?

00:10:33.321 --> 00:10:34.948
After seeing blood all morning…

00:10:44.040 --> 00:10:45.541
…I remain fervid.

00:10:53.841 --> 00:10:55.133
Fervid, I see.

00:10:55.134 --> 00:10:57.053
- Shall I get you some tea? - No.

00:10:58.096 --> 00:11:00.598
-  I need to catch up on sleep. - Wait.

00:11:01.933 --> 00:11:02.934
Your Royal Highness,

00:11:03.434 --> 00:11:06.520
as if hunting today were not bad enough, now you wish to take a nap?

00:11:06.521 --> 00:11:08.063
That will not do.

00:11:08.064 --> 00:11:10.191
- I mean, out of all days-- - Choi Hyeon.

00:11:11.985 --> 00:11:13.695
Aide Choi Hyeon.

00:11:18.908 --> 00:11:21.911
But today is His Majesty's Royal Birthday Banquet!

00:11:22.745 --> 00:11:23.746
:cue

00:11:26.958 --> 00:11:28.375
Please wave this way!

00:11:31.004 --> 00:11:33.756
- Look over here! - Please look over here!

00:11:36.592 --> 00:11:39.094
I'm currently standing outside the palace,

00:11:39.095 --> 00:11:41.263
where the Royal Birthday Banquet is being held.

00:11:41.264 --> 00:11:44.016
Distinguished guests of the royal family

00:11:44.017 --> 00:11:46.394
are arriving one after another.

00:12:27.727 --> 00:12:29.896
Ms. Seong, please look over here!

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:55.254
Did Seong Huiju really wear red to come to the palace?

00:12:55.755 --> 00:12:57.339
You know she's a clout chaser.

00:12:57.340 --> 00:12:58.757
Can't deny she's beautiful.

00:12:58.758 --> 00:13:00.343
- Go on. Take pictures. - All right.

00:13:00.885 --> 00:13:01.969
Get to work.

00:13:29.956 --> 00:13:32.290
All right! Ms. Seong has grabbed their attention.

00:13:32.291 --> 00:13:33.542
What do we do now?

00:13:33.543 --> 00:13:34.876
Now we begin!

00:13:34.877 --> 00:13:36.878
Go on! Get to it! Hurry up!

00:13:36.879 --> 00:13:39.381
We must sell out of everything she's wearing!

00:13:39.382 --> 00:13:41.299
Type faster!

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.718
Find all the photos and articles she's featured in.

00:13:43.719 --> 00:13:45.220
You will find them if you look.

00:13:45.221 --> 00:13:47.806
You must keep searching, and you must type faster.

00:13:47.807 --> 00:13:49.766
That's the spirit! We can do this, people!

00:13:49.767 --> 00:13:50.976
We are Castle Group!

00:13:50.977 --> 00:13:53.521
SEONG HUIJU'S RED SUIT STEALS THE SPOTLIGHT

00:13:55.731 --> 00:13:57.065
#SEONG HUIJU, #RED SUIT

00:13:57.066 --> 00:13:58.316
RETHINKING RED SUITS NOW…

00:13:58.317 --> 00:13:59.401
…SOLD OUT ALREADY…

00:13:59.402 --> 00:14:01.570
THE CUT OF THAT SUIT IS INSANE!

00:14:01.571 --> 00:14:03.655
Seong Huiju's suit! Seong Huiju's bag!

00:14:03.656 --> 00:14:04.739
Seong Huiju's shoes!

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:05.991
That's so pretty.

00:14:05.992 --> 00:14:08.161
Those are just too cute. I can't even.

00:14:08.786 --> 00:14:10.370
Sold out!

00:14:10.371 --> 00:14:11.663
SHE WEARS IT, IT SELLS OUT

00:14:11.664 --> 00:14:13.415
"Castle Group successor gets invited

00:14:13.416 --> 00:14:15.751
to His Majesty's Royal Birthday Banquet."

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:26.971
Have you been well?

00:14:49.702 --> 00:14:51.161
That's her, right?

00:14:51.162 --> 00:14:53.581
- The second child of Castle Group? - Second? As if.

00:14:54.332 --> 00:14:56.750
They didn't even know she existed until she was ten.

00:14:56.751 --> 00:14:58.210
What do you mean?

00:14:58.211 --> 00:15:00.086
The mistress raised her,

00:15:00.087 --> 00:15:01.714
and when she was about ten,

00:15:02.548 --> 00:15:04.008
she was sent to Chairman Seong.

00:15:04.592 --> 00:15:06.718
A commoner, born out of wedlock, no less?

00:15:06.719 --> 00:15:07.802
Yeah. :cue

00:15:07.803 --> 00:15:10.472
That would explain her various shortcomings.

00:15:10.473 --> 00:15:11.973
No sense of honor or dignity.

00:15:11.974 --> 00:15:13.767
Obnoxious and without a shred of sense.

00:15:13.768 --> 00:15:14.852
So on and so forth.

00:15:15.686 --> 00:15:17.062
In short, she's a psycho?

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:27.656
Cheers.

00:15:43.256 --> 00:15:47.051
Wow, is that CEO Seong, the industry's runner-up?

00:15:47.677 --> 00:15:49.511
Excuse me. I'll take one of those.

00:15:49.512 --> 00:15:50.513
Thank you.

00:15:51.389 --> 00:15:53.515
I know you can hear me.

00:15:53.516 --> 00:15:54.975
Then hear this. Get lost.

00:15:56.352 --> 00:15:58.979
Show some respect to your brother.

00:15:58.980 --> 00:16:01.898
This is why people call you uncultured.

00:16:01.899 --> 00:16:04.734
I thought you at least possessed some business prowess, but…

00:16:06.404 --> 00:16:08.489
I heard your sales slipped recently.

00:16:09.448 --> 00:16:10.908
I just don't understand it.

00:16:12.201 --> 00:16:14.662
Rumors have spread far and wide.

00:16:15.288 --> 00:16:16.455
I know.

00:16:16.998 --> 00:16:18.248
Far and wide, right?

00:16:19.959 --> 00:16:22.378
We don't have any flashy ad campaigns.

00:16:23.004 --> 00:16:24.088
No discounts, either.

00:16:25.006 --> 00:16:27.382
Despite all your stunts like the ad campaign, virality,

00:16:27.383 --> 00:16:30.552
and even the half-off sales event, my brand still took

00:16:30.553 --> 00:16:33.305
the top spot in the preference survey, surpassing yours.

00:16:33.306 --> 00:16:35.474
Common knowledge, apparently.

00:16:37.143 --> 00:16:39.562
I'm concerned about pushback on the high price point.

00:16:40.646 --> 00:16:42.814
But cutting prices would just kill me.

00:16:42.815 --> 00:16:44.400
It feels so bargain-bin.

00:16:45.735 --> 00:16:46.818
Just like somebody.

00:16:46.819 --> 00:16:49.321
What, "Bargain-bin"?

00:16:49.322 --> 00:16:50.697
Unbelievable.

00:16:50.698 --> 00:16:53.199
Hey, that's just your inferiority complex talking.

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:55.744
My…  …inferiority complex?

00:16:55.745 --> 00:16:57.203
- Me? - Yeah.

00:16:57.204 --> 00:16:58.497
- Triggered by you? - Yeah.

00:16:59.206 --> 00:17:02.000
You're clearly obsessed with luxury marketing

00:17:02.001 --> 00:17:04.210
because deep inside, you're a knockoff.

00:17:04.211 --> 00:17:06.797
I get you're trying hard to cover up your lowly origins,

00:17:07.548 --> 00:17:11.093
but please just try to live a life benefiting your station.

00:17:11.927 --> 00:17:14.429
Stop glaring, you brat.

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:16.222
I'm your older brother.

00:17:16.223 --> 00:17:19.225
I just hate seeing you like that as your older brother.

00:17:19.226 --> 00:17:21.937
Maybe we're only half, but at the end of the day,

00:17:22.438 --> 00:17:24.230
we're still siblings.

00:17:24.231 --> 00:17:26.192
Hmm? Right?

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:28.693
Yapping away like a little lapdog.

00:17:28.694 --> 00:17:31.029
What? Why you--

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:34.658
If you're going to yap like that, at least wear a leash.

00:17:34.659 --> 00:17:37.369
A leash I could pull to choke you with.

00:17:39.538 --> 00:17:41.956
Also, it's "a life befitting your station,"

00:17:41.957 --> 00:17:45.127
not "a life benefiting your station," you moron.

00:17:52.218 --> 00:17:54.136
We will now make our way to Junghwajeon Hall.

00:18:10.319 --> 00:18:12.363
We're a package deal here.

00:18:14.448 --> 00:18:15.616
Just two-bit peddlers.

00:18:39.515 --> 00:18:42.101
I can't see anything from back here.

00:18:42.601 --> 00:18:44.145
That pillar isn't helping.

00:18:46.021 --> 00:18:47.314
:cue

00:18:58.534 --> 00:18:59.744
Oh, boy.

00:19:11.172 --> 00:19:12.173
Your Majesty.

00:19:34.195 --> 00:19:36.155
Why aren't they starting?

00:19:36.655 --> 00:19:38.824
Grand Prince I-AN isn't here yet.

00:19:40.326 --> 00:19:41.827
What's taking him so long?

00:20:09.605 --> 00:20:11.148
Announcing Grand Prince I-AN.

00:21:08.539 --> 00:21:10.540
Hey, look at what he's wearing.

00:21:10.541 --> 00:21:11.791
Is he here for a hunt?

00:21:11.792 --> 00:21:12.793
Shut it.

00:21:22.595 --> 00:21:23.888
My apologies, Your Majesty.

00:21:25.598 --> 00:21:26.681
Queen Mother Yun.

00:21:26.682 --> 00:21:28.142
Uncle!

00:21:29.143 --> 00:21:30.643
Please accept my warmest wishes.

00:21:30.644 --> 00:21:32.187
What manner of attire is this?

00:21:34.648 --> 00:21:37.276
His Majesty bestowed this silk upon me some time ago.

00:21:38.027 --> 00:21:39.360
Is it not to your liking?

00:21:39.361 --> 00:21:41.029
It looks so good on you--

00:21:41.030 --> 00:21:42.448
You must observe decorum.

00:21:43.699 --> 00:21:46.076
Hunting season has passed.

00:21:47.995 --> 00:21:49.955
Do you believe hunting is limited to a season?

00:21:52.958 --> 00:21:54.209
You can lecture me later.

00:21:56.462 --> 00:21:57.546
I must take my seat…

00:22:00.507 --> 00:22:01.884
for all of them to take theirs.

00:22:06.180 --> 00:22:07.765
:cue

00:22:36.877 --> 00:22:38.419
The nation has been celebrating

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:40.631
in honor of His Majesty's royal birthday.

00:22:41.423 --> 00:22:43.716
Events at Cheonggyecheon Stream and Gwanghwamun

00:22:43.717 --> 00:22:45.678
are set to carry on throughout the night.

00:22:46.553 --> 00:22:49.514
With the day designated a public holiday, heavy traffic is expected

00:22:49.515 --> 00:22:51.224
as crowds head out for the break.

00:22:57.231 --> 00:22:59.649
Following the ceremony featuring the formal greetings,

00:22:59.650 --> 00:23:02.777
the second half will begin alongside a Nakhwa Nori display.

00:23:05.489 --> 00:23:09.033
After His Majesty writes down a wish and presents it to Grand Prince I-AN,

00:23:09.034 --> 00:23:12.371
His Royal Highness will commence the Nakhwa Nori.

00:23:19.712 --> 00:23:22.798
Good health for Queen Mother.

00:23:24.049 --> 00:23:27.052
Good health for Uncle.

00:23:32.558 --> 00:23:37.062
Happiness for the people.

00:23:39.898 --> 00:23:42.067
Well done, Your Majesty.

00:24:38.957 --> 00:24:42.043
- Hello, Prime Minister Min. - It's nice to see you, sir.

00:24:42.044 --> 00:24:44.171
- Hello there. - I'm always rooting for you.

00:24:45.255 --> 00:24:47.256
Thank you for all your hard work.

00:24:47.257 --> 00:24:49.509
-  It's nice to see you. -  So handsome.

00:24:49.510 --> 00:24:50.719
My goodness.

00:24:56.350 --> 00:24:57.433
Seong Huiju.

00:24:57.434 --> 00:24:58.852
Ooh.

00:25:00.395 --> 00:25:03.689
- Should I call you Prime Minister Min? -  Come on now.

00:25:03.690 --> 00:25:05.233
Don't. That'd be so awkward.

00:25:06.819 --> 00:25:09.529
Look at that rosy pink floral overcoat.

00:25:09.530 --> 00:25:11.156
You didn't come to play.

00:25:12.032 --> 00:25:15.410
The Cabinet would bite my head off if I showed up here in civilian clothes.

00:25:17.121 --> 00:25:19.080
Where were you? I couldn't find you earlier.

00:25:19.081 --> 00:25:21.624
I was all the way in the back.

00:25:21.625 --> 00:25:23.501
And you must've been in the front row.

00:25:23.502 --> 00:25:25.129
How's the front row? Is it fun?

00:25:25.754 --> 00:25:28.382
Don't get me started. It was so boring I almost fell asleep.

00:25:29.049 --> 00:25:30.133
It was pure torture.

00:25:33.929 --> 00:25:36.139
- You've been crushing it. - Me?

00:25:36.140 --> 00:25:38.683
I hear Castle Beauty's US rollout is going well.

00:25:38.684 --> 00:25:39.767
Hmm.

00:25:39.768 --> 00:25:41.686
I'm sure everyone is secretly shocked.

00:25:41.687 --> 00:25:44.522
Taeju tried and failed at the same venture two years ago.

00:25:44.523 --> 00:25:45.648
Come on.

00:25:45.649 --> 00:25:47.733
You know I'm in a different league than him.

00:25:52.406 --> 00:25:55.283
But… was this outfit intentional?

00:25:55.284 --> 00:25:56.576
Yeah.

00:25:56.577 --> 00:25:58.077
Why? You don't like it?

00:25:59.538 --> 00:26:01.664
I thought red wasn't permitted in the palace.

00:26:01.665 --> 00:26:05.459
Who cares? It's not like I'm breaking any laws.

00:26:05.460 --> 00:26:08.588
You should still be careful. It could lead to controversy. :cue

00:26:08.589 --> 00:26:10.673
What's so bad about a little controversy?

00:26:10.674 --> 00:26:12.717
Nobody knows who Seong Taeju is,

00:26:12.718 --> 00:26:14.468
but everyone knows Seong Huiju.

00:26:14.469 --> 00:26:16.804
They know I'm the CEO of Castle Beauty

00:26:16.805 --> 00:26:18.724
and that I'm an illegitimate child.

00:26:19.516 --> 00:26:21.310
Hey.

00:26:22.895 --> 00:26:23.896
Prime Minister Min.

00:26:34.990 --> 00:26:36.240
I need to go.

00:26:36.241 --> 00:26:38.576
Make some time for me soon. Let's grab a bite.

00:26:38.577 --> 00:26:40.287
As long as you don't show up in that.

00:26:42.039 --> 00:26:44.625
That's enough teasing.

00:26:45.792 --> 00:26:46.793
Bye.

00:26:48.128 --> 00:26:50.172
- Prime Minister Min. -  Hello.

00:27:07.731 --> 00:27:08.732
Your Royal Highness.

00:27:20.369 --> 00:27:22.870
How many times have I told you not to run off alone?

00:27:22.871 --> 00:27:23.996
Why?

00:27:23.997 --> 00:27:26.375
Are you afraid I might be assassinated quietly?

00:27:26.875 --> 00:27:29.418
I'm more worried about your aide dying from stress.

00:27:29.419 --> 00:27:31.128
You disappeared, and he came running…

00:27:33.632 --> 00:27:36.467
You should just be more careful. You're precious cargo.

00:27:37.928 --> 00:27:39.304
Why aren't you getting married?

00:27:40.347 --> 00:27:41.555
That's random.

00:27:41.556 --> 00:27:45.267
Half the maidens at the banquet couldn't stop staring at you.

00:27:45.268 --> 00:27:47.311
What's this now?

00:27:47.312 --> 00:27:49.231
The other half… No.

00:27:49.773 --> 00:27:51.983
More than half of them were staring at me.

00:27:57.030 --> 00:27:58.031
So?

00:27:58.657 --> 00:28:00.784
You want to marry me off and steal the spotlight?

00:28:02.911 --> 00:28:04.287
Quite the opposite, actually.

00:28:05.288 --> 00:28:06.497
Pardon?

00:28:06.498 --> 00:28:08.166
It appears I'll soon be married.

00:28:09.876 --> 00:28:10.877
You will?

00:28:12.004 --> 00:28:15.257
My sister-in-law presses me to take a spouse day after day.

00:28:17.342 --> 00:28:19.052
It'll happen sooner rather than later.

00:28:21.138 --> 00:28:23.682
That will make your life quite difficult.

00:28:25.392 --> 00:28:26.475
Me?

00:28:26.476 --> 00:28:28.602
I'd have to leave the palace if I got married.

00:28:28.603 --> 00:28:31.523
It'll be difficult to serve as regent from outside the palace.

00:28:32.024 --> 00:28:35.109
But His Majesty, at the tender age of eight,

00:28:35.110 --> 00:28:37.029
cannot attend to state affairs.

00:28:40.615 --> 00:28:41.950
The duties you dumped on me,

00:28:43.201 --> 00:28:45.119
including the various charity events,

00:28:45.120 --> 00:28:46.746
hosting of diplomatic delegations,

00:28:46.747 --> 00:28:49.499
visiting international organizations, cultural heritage management,

00:28:51.001 --> 00:28:54.128
and the unbearably dull military ceremonies

00:28:54.129 --> 00:28:56.464
will all fall to you once more.

00:28:57.924 --> 00:28:59.051
What could go wrong?

00:29:00.552 --> 00:29:01.635
That will not do.

00:29:03.680 --> 00:29:05.515
No. Absolutely not.

00:29:06.808 --> 00:29:08.184
That cannot happen.

00:29:08.185 --> 00:29:11.479
We're already short on royals able to attend to state affairs.

00:29:11.480 --> 00:29:12.605
If you leave, we won't have--

00:29:12.606 --> 00:29:14.649
- Then block it. - What?

00:29:16.276 --> 00:29:17.693
Use your veto power.

00:29:17.694 --> 00:29:20.238
A royal marriage requires the approval of the Cabinet.

00:29:21.281 --> 00:29:22.365
The Royal Family Act.

00:29:33.752 --> 00:29:35.961
He could've just said that from the start.

00:29:35.962 --> 00:29:37.881
Did he need to make me sweat? :cue

00:29:42.010 --> 00:29:43.386
Seriously?

00:29:44.221 --> 00:29:46.931
I can't believe they really cut off cell service for this.

00:29:46.932 --> 00:29:48.892
Who goes there?

00:29:52.813 --> 00:29:53.855
Your Royal Highness.

00:30:08.161 --> 00:30:09.162
Name.

00:30:16.461 --> 00:30:17.587
Please forgive me.

00:30:18.463 --> 00:30:20.298
I seem to have lost my way.

00:30:21.508 --> 00:30:22.592
Your name.

00:30:24.886 --> 00:30:26.012
It is Seong Huiju.

00:30:27.055 --> 00:30:28.181
Affiliation.

00:30:29.307 --> 00:30:31.143
I am not a member of the palace staff.

00:30:34.688 --> 00:30:36.231
Why is an outsider to the court…

00:30:38.150 --> 00:30:40.152
loitering in an area…

00:30:42.904 --> 00:30:44.030
not open to the public?

00:30:48.076 --> 00:30:51.037
If you're gone in the count of three, I'll overlook it.

00:30:52.122 --> 00:30:53.123
Really?

00:30:56.710 --> 00:30:58.837
That much I can do for my junior alum.

00:31:00.046 --> 00:31:01.590
That makes sense…

00:31:03.675 --> 00:31:05.468
- Pardon? - One.

00:31:06.678 --> 00:31:08.221
Two.

00:31:10.557 --> 00:31:11.558
What was that?

00:31:12.726 --> 00:31:13.768
You stay here.

00:31:36.374 --> 00:31:38.585
Your Majesty!

00:31:55.727 --> 00:31:56.978
Are you unharmed?

00:31:58.563 --> 00:31:59.606
What about His Majesty?

00:32:04.444 --> 00:32:05.695
Do you once more seek…

00:32:07.697 --> 00:32:09.908
the life of another sovereign?

00:32:18.333 --> 00:32:19.334
Queen Mother!

00:32:23.964 --> 00:32:24.965
Your Majesty.

00:32:28.009 --> 00:32:29.761
Are you all right?

00:32:39.521 --> 00:32:40.855
Manage the optics.

00:32:41.606 --> 00:32:44.442
Keep the press under control to prevent any conspiracy theories.

00:32:45.026 --> 00:32:46.694
Aren't we taking this too lightly?

00:32:46.695 --> 00:32:48.112
No need to overthink it.

00:32:48.113 --> 00:32:49.823
There were no injuries or fatalities.

00:32:52.033 --> 00:32:54.619
The late King passed away in a fire three years ago.

00:32:55.287 --> 00:32:57.955
The monarchy has only recently stabilized.

00:32:57.956 --> 00:32:59.039
And now, another fire?

00:32:59.040 --> 00:33:01.042
That won't do at all.

00:33:06.673 --> 00:33:08.174
It shouldn't be over already.

00:33:09.009 --> 00:33:10.175
Why…

00:33:10.176 --> 00:33:11.385
Hold on.

00:33:11.386 --> 00:33:12.970
Don't tell me you just walked out.

00:33:12.971 --> 00:33:14.179
What?

00:33:14.180 --> 00:33:15.264
Oh.

00:33:15.265 --> 00:33:17.350
Tell me you didn't just leave to draw attention.

00:33:18.727 --> 00:33:20.562
I couldn't even if I tried.

00:33:21.062 --> 00:33:22.938
- Why not? - There was an incident.

00:33:22.939 --> 00:33:24.440
You caused an incident?

00:33:24.441 --> 00:33:25.566
Seriously?

00:33:25.567 --> 00:33:27.818
- There was a fire. - A fire?

00:33:27.819 --> 00:33:29.903
Wait. A fire?

00:33:29.904 --> 00:33:32.407
What about the Grand Prince? Is he okay?

00:33:33.992 --> 00:33:35.367
Ms. Do.

00:33:35.368 --> 00:33:36.828
Are you a fan of Prince I-AN?

00:33:38.038 --> 00:33:39.331
Me?

00:33:43.543 --> 00:33:44.586
I mean…

00:33:48.673 --> 00:33:51.467
An explosion has occurred at Junghwajeon Hall.

00:33:51.468 --> 00:33:54.345
It occurred during the Royal Birthday Banquet,

00:33:54.346 --> 00:33:58.599
but fortunately, no casualties have been reported.

00:33:58.600 --> 00:34:00.477
The police and fire department… :cue

00:34:03.438 --> 00:34:04.981
Is there some bad blood?

00:34:05.690 --> 00:34:06.774
What?

00:34:06.775 --> 00:34:10.361
Grand Prince I-AN also attended the Royal Academy of Korea.

00:34:10.362 --> 00:34:13.238
I thought you might've been bullied or something.

00:34:13.239 --> 00:34:14.573
You're so hostile toward him.

00:34:16.076 --> 00:34:17.202
Yeah, right.

00:34:18.495 --> 00:34:21.330
Do I look like someone who would be bullied?

00:34:22.457 --> 00:34:23.458
That's true.

00:34:24.376 --> 00:34:25.835
Then why do you hate him so much?

00:34:27.295 --> 00:34:28.296
Just because.

00:34:30.507 --> 00:34:31.591
He's obnoxious.

00:34:39.599 --> 00:34:41.768
Please work. Come on.

00:34:43.228 --> 00:34:44.270
Please.

00:35:26.563 --> 00:35:27.564
Who goes there?

00:35:44.914 --> 00:35:48.460
If you've done wrong, you must accept a fair punishment.

00:35:49.127 --> 00:35:51.587
Don't disgrace yourself by getting caught in flight.

00:35:51.588 --> 00:35:52.922
Name.

00:35:58.720 --> 00:35:59.846
It's Seong Huiju.

00:36:00.430 --> 00:36:01.639
Affiliation.

00:36:03.933 --> 00:36:06.727
Jujak House. Ninth grade.

00:36:06.728 --> 00:36:08.520
You know you violated school regulations.

00:36:08.521 --> 00:36:11.899
I needed more training time. The exhibition match is coming up--

00:36:11.900 --> 00:36:13.693
Are you a man of virtue or of profit?

00:36:17.030 --> 00:36:19.323
Students under tenth grade are prohibited

00:36:19.324 --> 00:36:21.241
from leaving the dormitory after 11 p.m.

00:36:21.242 --> 00:36:23.744
Violation of this rule results in 20 demerit points.

00:36:23.745 --> 00:36:26.038
Use of facilities outside designated training hours

00:36:26.039 --> 00:36:28.040
requires prior approval from the principal.

00:36:28.041 --> 00:36:30.584
Violation of this rule results in 10 demerit points.

00:36:30.585 --> 00:36:32.545
- In total… - And Your Royal Highness?

00:36:33.505 --> 00:36:35.173
You are here too, are you not?

00:36:36.007 --> 00:36:37.967
Will you receive demerit points as well?

00:36:45.850 --> 00:36:47.393
I'm here with approval.

00:36:51.606 --> 00:36:53.274
ARCHERY RANGE USAGE APPROVAL

00:36:54.692 --> 00:36:55.901
How'd you get this?

00:36:55.902 --> 00:36:59.655
After all that talk about students getting carried away for the exhibition match

00:36:59.656 --> 00:37:02.826
and the archery range not being meant for individual training?

00:37:08.706 --> 00:37:11.917
I got this key from Ryu Minseok, Cheongnyong House, ninth grade.

00:37:11.918 --> 00:37:13.877
- Ryu Minseok? - Yes.

00:37:13.878 --> 00:37:16.213
He was shamelessly bragging about having this key,

00:37:16.214 --> 00:37:17.381
so I stole it.

00:37:18.758 --> 00:37:21.718
I'm not sure why an individual had a key to this archery range

00:37:21.719 --> 00:37:24.055
when it's not a place for individual training.

00:37:27.642 --> 00:37:30.311
But seeing how easily you obtained this approval notice,

00:37:31.312 --> 00:37:33.690
I guess it was only out of reach for me.

00:37:36.484 --> 00:37:38.902
So do not lecture me about demerit points or whatever.

00:37:38.903 --> 00:37:39.904
I intend

00:37:40.530 --> 00:37:42.532
to enjoy every opportunity

00:37:43.324 --> 00:37:44.533
my enemy enjoys.

00:37:44.534 --> 00:37:46.201
You wish to stoop to their level?

00:37:46.202 --> 00:37:48.412
I'd rather play dirty and win

00:37:48.413 --> 00:37:50.707
than play clean and lose.

00:38:17.191 --> 00:38:18.359
So obnoxious.

00:38:22.155 --> 00:38:23.489
:cue

00:38:40.465 --> 00:38:43.593
Your Royal Highness. The Queen Mother has arrived.

00:38:47.388 --> 00:38:48.389
Escort her in.

00:38:59.192 --> 00:39:00.984
IN TIMES OF PEACE, DO NOT FORGET DANGER

00:39:00.985 --> 00:39:02.945
IN TIMES OF PROSPERITY, DO NOT FORGET RUIN

00:39:02.946 --> 00:39:04.697
IN TIMES OF ORDER, DO NOT FORGET CHAOS

00:39:16.501 --> 00:39:17.627
Must I wait longer?

00:39:21.547 --> 00:39:22.548
Grand Prince.

00:39:24.425 --> 00:39:25.593
Yes?

00:39:26.970 --> 00:39:28.054
About yesterday…

00:39:31.224 --> 00:39:32.225
I regret my actions.

00:39:34.435 --> 00:39:36.187
I was not in my right mind.

00:39:37.480 --> 00:39:39.648
I feared some misfortune had struck His Majesty.

00:39:39.649 --> 00:39:41.693
Prime Minister Min has asked for the details

00:39:42.735 --> 00:39:44.569
of how the Queen Mother

00:39:44.570 --> 00:39:47.907
dared to strike the Grand Prince and lash out with such unspeakable words.

00:39:50.201 --> 00:39:51.285
So I hear.

00:39:56.040 --> 00:39:57.250
Do not worry.

00:39:58.835 --> 00:40:00.795
I shall tell him you took responsibility

00:40:01.629 --> 00:40:02.755
and expressed remorse

00:40:04.298 --> 00:40:05.633
for your actions.

00:40:09.178 --> 00:40:11.597
No one shows concern for His Majesty.

00:40:12.807 --> 00:40:14.100
The palace was on fire,

00:40:15.059 --> 00:40:16.686
and the King almost died.

00:40:18.396 --> 00:40:21.732
Yet all anyone seems to care about is the scratch on your cheek.

00:40:21.733 --> 00:40:23.025
Am I to blame for that?

00:40:23.026 --> 00:40:25.528
Yes, you are. You are the regent.

00:40:34.037 --> 00:40:36.705
His Majesty is a mere eight years of age.

00:40:36.706 --> 00:40:39.000
Far too young to be overseeing state affairs.

00:40:40.168 --> 00:40:41.586
So my regency is unavoidable.

00:40:44.630 --> 00:40:45.882
- I-AN… - Furthermore,

00:40:47.467 --> 00:40:49.426
a regent holds no special powers.

00:40:49.427 --> 00:40:50.762
- I-AN! - Politicians…

00:40:53.639 --> 00:40:55.308
engage in politics.

00:40:57.435 --> 00:40:59.062
Peddlers engage in business.

00:41:05.902 --> 00:41:07.570
The monarchy remains passive.

00:41:09.405 --> 00:41:11.240
Simply doing nothing…

00:41:13.951 --> 00:41:15.203
is its sole duty.

00:41:18.915 --> 00:41:21.501
Have you ever considered that to be true power?

00:41:22.835 --> 00:41:24.087
The politicians

00:41:24.670 --> 00:41:27.673
burn with fervor to claim a place at your side.

00:41:28.883 --> 00:41:31.094
Because a single photo taken beside you

00:41:31.594 --> 00:41:34.514
wields greater power than ten pledges wrought with painstaking care.

00:41:35.306 --> 00:41:36.640
And the business elites?

00:41:36.641 --> 00:41:40.519
They hasten to attend to you on every diplomatic tour.

00:41:40.520 --> 00:41:43.606
The mere fact that you granted them a place by your side

00:41:45.191 --> 00:41:47.318
is enough to gain the trust of their investors.

00:41:51.322 --> 00:41:52.365
You eclipse…

00:41:56.160 --> 00:41:57.703
the Crown itself.

00:42:09.465 --> 00:42:10.674
Father.

00:42:10.675 --> 00:42:13.344
I have received a 100 on my exam.

00:42:17.348 --> 00:42:19.641
- Rise above such trifles. - Sorry?

00:42:19.642 --> 00:42:21.852
If it be remarkable, it is but the natural order.

00:42:21.853 --> 00:42:23.062
If it be lacking,

00:42:23.646 --> 00:42:25.605
it is but a cause for shame.

00:42:25.606 --> 00:42:27.232
But Father,

00:42:27.233 --> 00:42:30.610
is diligence not the duty of a man of virtue?

00:42:30.611 --> 00:42:34.072
You are a Grand Prince before you are a man of virtue.

00:42:34.073 --> 00:42:35.490
I-SHIN

00:42:35.491 --> 00:42:37.368
That is your new royal title.

00:42:38.911 --> 00:42:42.122
My royal title is to change?

00:42:42.123 --> 00:42:44.625
It is a reminder to remain true and just.

00:42:46.878 --> 00:42:49.255
Do not stand in the way of the Crown Prince. :cue

00:43:02.768 --> 00:43:04.812
This is your new royal title.

00:43:05.521 --> 00:43:07.064
I-AN

00:43:08.900 --> 00:43:09.984
Am I being…

00:43:12.987 --> 00:43:13.988
rewarded again?

00:43:27.126 --> 00:43:28.127
And so…

00:43:30.671 --> 00:43:32.048
what do you seek from me?

00:43:33.341 --> 00:43:35.759
That you be His Majesty's steadfast pillar of support.

00:43:35.760 --> 00:43:37.386
I already serve in that capacity.

00:43:38.346 --> 00:43:39.722
Proceed to your nuptials.

00:43:43.142 --> 00:43:45.311
Wed the woman of my choosing

00:43:46.562 --> 00:43:49.690
and demonstrate your allegiance to His Majesty and me.

00:44:01.244 --> 00:44:03.037
I told you I don't want to.

00:44:04.914 --> 00:44:06.539
Fine.

00:44:06.540 --> 00:44:09.460
Let's say I concede to everything, and I do get married.

00:44:10.127 --> 00:44:14.131
I am still an heir to a conglomerate, so strategic M&A is certainly important.

00:44:14.674 --> 00:44:17.384
That's my role in fortifying the family's legacy.

00:44:17.385 --> 00:44:20.011
But the CEO of a mere subsidiary simply will not do.

00:44:20.012 --> 00:44:21.638
Do you think that makes any sense?

00:44:21.639 --> 00:44:22.889
I'm Seong Huiju!

00:44:22.890 --> 00:44:24.350
So what if you are?

00:44:25.017 --> 00:44:26.102
Father, we're here.

00:44:26.769 --> 00:44:27.852
Hey.

00:44:27.853 --> 00:44:29.813
Must you be so loud?

00:44:29.814 --> 00:44:31.606
All you do is bark day and night.

00:44:31.607 --> 00:44:33.900
Hello, Father. Huiju.

00:44:33.901 --> 00:44:35.568
Honey, you want a cup?

00:44:35.569 --> 00:44:37.779
- So hot! - You should be more careful, honey.

00:44:39.156 --> 00:44:40.157
You could've warned me.

00:44:43.536 --> 00:44:46.496
Don't pester Father too much, Huiju.

00:44:46.497 --> 00:44:48.790
He went to great lengths

00:44:48.791 --> 00:44:51.376
to find a proper suitor for you.

00:44:55.589 --> 00:44:57.466
So you two collaborated on this?

00:44:58.092 --> 00:44:59.968
And this is the result?

00:44:59.969 --> 00:45:02.595
A nobody who doesn't even make the industry rankings?

00:45:02.596 --> 00:45:04.556
Shall I use him as a trophy boyfriend?

00:45:04.557 --> 00:45:06.142
Why you little…

00:45:08.352 --> 00:45:10.146
Our hands are tied.

00:45:10.813 --> 00:45:12.564
When it comes to arranged marriages,

00:45:12.565 --> 00:45:15.650
most families tend to nitpick every detail.

00:45:15.651 --> 00:45:16.652
"Every detail"?

00:45:18.779 --> 00:45:19.989
"Every detail"?

00:45:22.992 --> 00:45:26.995
So you also nitpicked "every detail" and ended up with this loser?

00:45:26.996 --> 00:45:28.580
That's strange.

00:45:28.581 --> 00:45:31.499
With all that nitpicking, you had to see the marriage was doomed.

00:45:31.500 --> 00:45:34.919
- Hey, we married for love! - Who cares what the in-laws' pet thinks?

00:45:34.920 --> 00:45:36.756
- What was that? - That's enough!

00:45:38.466 --> 00:45:40.801
She's just impossible.

00:45:41.719 --> 00:45:43.928
As you said, you'll eventually have to marry.

00:45:43.929 --> 00:45:45.555
Who said I didn't want to marry?

00:45:45.556 --> 00:45:48.141
I just don't want to marry someone that far beneath me.

00:45:49.268 --> 00:45:52.187
Father, just be honest with me.

00:45:52.188 --> 00:45:54.439
You want to take this chance to get rid of me, no?

00:45:54.440 --> 00:45:57.442
Because based on pure competence, that jerk wouldn't stand a chance.

00:45:57.443 --> 00:46:00.403
Hey, who wouldn't stand a chance?

00:46:00.404 --> 00:46:01.906
You, obviously. Certainly not me!

00:46:06.077 --> 00:46:07.827
I guess branding me illegitimate

00:46:07.828 --> 00:46:10.622
and saddling me with a useless brother wasn't enough?

00:46:10.623 --> 00:46:13.751
Now you want to foist an incompetent husband upon me as well?

00:46:15.419 --> 00:46:16.879
This will not go

00:46:17.838 --> 00:46:19.173
as you wish, Father.

00:46:20.758 --> 00:46:22.510
I won't let that happen.

00:46:29.392 --> 00:46:30.600
Nuptials?

00:46:30.601 --> 00:46:32.645
Did you agree to it?

00:46:34.271 --> 00:46:35.814
Maybe.

00:46:35.815 --> 00:46:36.816
You're really going to?

00:46:39.860 --> 00:46:40.985
Why not?

00:46:42.863 --> 00:46:46.409
Since when did Your Royal Highness become so obedient?

00:46:48.160 --> 00:46:50.079
And since when have you grown so insolent?

00:46:52.957 --> 00:46:54.040
My apologies, sir.

00:46:54.041 --> 00:46:56.626
I'm just frustrated with the situation, that's all.

00:46:56.627 --> 00:46:59.671
I mean, all this time, she was firmly against your nuptials.

00:46:59.672 --> 00:47:02.006
And now, she wants you to get married?

00:47:02.007 --> 00:47:04.217
To a woman she chooses, no less?

00:47:04.218 --> 00:47:05.760
This is downright unreasonable.

00:47:05.761 --> 00:47:07.346
Darn it.

00:47:08.973 --> 00:47:10.975
:cue

00:47:15.438 --> 00:47:17.356
We did this last year.

00:47:18.691 --> 00:47:20.526
And this is what our competitor is doing.

00:47:21.986 --> 00:47:24.989
Did you need more time or something?

00:47:25.823 --> 00:47:27.907
Ms. Seong, the thing about PR is--

00:47:27.908 --> 00:47:30.453
Don't tell me there are only so many ways to spin it.

00:47:30.953 --> 00:47:33.580
If that's your excuse, you should resign.

00:47:33.581 --> 00:47:35.582
You're saying anyone could do your job.

00:47:35.583 --> 00:47:38.251
If it's all the same, why carry a bloated payroll?

00:47:38.252 --> 00:47:39.587
My apologies.

00:47:40.671 --> 00:47:43.466
We'll revise based on your feedback and get back to you, ma'am.

00:47:59.857 --> 00:48:00.858
Here we go.

00:48:04.528 --> 00:48:06.197
Drink some. It's lotus root tea.

00:48:11.577 --> 00:48:13.119
Isn't this super bitter?

00:48:13.120 --> 00:48:15.914
Come on. Just drink it.

00:48:15.915 --> 00:48:17.750
It soothes pent-up anger.

00:48:18.334 --> 00:48:19.834
I don't have any pent-up anger.

00:48:19.835 --> 00:48:22.213
You've been riding the staff for days now.

00:48:25.132 --> 00:48:28.593
Listen, I know you're on edge with the marriage issue and all,

00:48:28.594 --> 00:48:30.679
but don't drag personal issues into the workplace.

00:48:31.263 --> 00:48:33.181
- You look really petty. - What?

00:48:33.182 --> 00:48:34.308
"Petty"?

00:48:35.142 --> 00:48:37.352
Who? Me?

00:48:37.353 --> 00:48:39.855
Ms. Do. I am Seong Huiju!

00:48:40.481 --> 00:48:42.191
Yeah, sure. Here.

00:48:44.443 --> 00:48:46.612
Go on.

00:48:47.655 --> 00:48:48.656
Drink it.

00:48:55.871 --> 00:48:57.039
So bitter.

00:49:17.601 --> 00:49:18.727
Your Royal Highness.

00:49:19.812 --> 00:49:20.813
Lord INPYEONG.

00:49:21.939 --> 00:49:24.149
It appears you are leaving the palace.

00:49:25.317 --> 00:49:27.278
Yes, I am taking some time off.

00:49:27.861 --> 00:49:28.945
"Time off"?

00:49:28.946 --> 00:49:32.533
His Majesty's birthday preparations had me held up in the palace for a while.

00:49:35.160 --> 00:49:37.870
I intend to spend a few days resting at my private residence.

00:49:37.871 --> 00:49:39.789
Your private residence?

00:49:39.790 --> 00:49:42.709
Then who will safeguard the palace, Your Royal Highness?

00:49:42.710 --> 00:49:46.421
What would we do if you were to leave the palace alone

00:49:46.422 --> 00:49:47.715
and misfortune befell you?

00:49:50.676 --> 00:49:52.803
I thought you would welcome my absence.

00:50:01.854 --> 00:50:04.356
Perhaps I was under the wrong impression.

00:50:05.482 --> 00:50:07.359
Please give my best to Queen Mother.

00:50:07.943 --> 00:50:12.156
I was so excited about my time off that I forgot to pay my respects. :cue

00:50:30.924 --> 00:50:33.385
Is that what you said to him?

00:50:35.429 --> 00:50:37.264
It was His Majesty's royal birthday.

00:50:38.599 --> 00:50:40.267
He showed up late…

00:50:41.602 --> 00:50:42.853
wearing a cheollik.

00:50:43.354 --> 00:50:45.480
A fire even broke out.

00:50:45.481 --> 00:50:46.814
That was all I-AN--

00:50:46.815 --> 00:50:47.816
Your Majesty.

00:50:56.408 --> 00:50:58.369
And the members of the royal family?

00:50:58.994 --> 00:51:02.246
Despite tirelessly preaching propriety, they do not dare utter

00:51:02.247 --> 00:51:05.000
a single word of remonstrance before the Grand Prince.

00:51:08.003 --> 00:51:10.005
The people cherish the Grand Prince.

00:51:12.091 --> 00:51:14.385
Even after losing his parents and brother,

00:51:15.177 --> 00:51:18.054
he continues to serve as regent for his nephew,

00:51:18.055 --> 00:51:20.724
safeguarding the Crown.

00:51:24.812 --> 00:51:26.563
That is precisely the issue.

00:51:29.108 --> 00:51:31.276
His Majesty is but a child, throwing the disparity

00:51:31.860 --> 00:51:35.364
between him and the Grand Prince behind him into even starker relief.

00:51:47.251 --> 00:51:49.085
KIM YEONGHUN, CEO OF SEONGSAN TEXTILE

00:51:49.086 --> 00:51:50.170
None of them?

00:51:50.671 --> 00:51:51.880
Come on.

00:51:52.423 --> 00:51:56.008
How are they any different from the men Father picked?

00:51:56.009 --> 00:51:59.178
At least be handsome if you're a lost cause in the corporate rankings.

00:51:59.179 --> 00:52:01.180
No money.

00:52:01.181 --> 00:52:02.932
No looks to speak of.

00:52:02.933 --> 00:52:04.017
Tsk, tsk, tsk.

00:52:04.977 --> 00:52:07.354
What about politicians? No candidates there?

00:52:08.021 --> 00:52:09.647
Why is it all businessmen?

00:52:09.648 --> 00:52:12.108
Politicians don't like mixing with business people.

00:52:12.109 --> 00:52:14.944
They love money but hate business people?

00:52:14.945 --> 00:52:16.487
Too much potential baggage.

00:52:16.488 --> 00:52:18.907
- Illegal succession, tax evasion… - What?

00:52:19.575 --> 00:52:20.742
That's ridiculous.

00:52:20.743 --> 00:52:23.286
Either way, politicians are a no-go.

00:52:23.287 --> 00:52:25.872
They traditionally prefer aristocrats.

00:52:25.873 --> 00:52:27.790
Aristocrats? You must be kidding.

00:52:27.791 --> 00:52:30.668
Are we living in the Joseon era? Are they trying to marry up?

00:52:30.669 --> 00:52:32.713
That's not something for you to say.

00:52:34.173 --> 00:52:37.968
Ms. Do. Come on, Ms. Do!

00:52:38.719 --> 00:52:44.015
I'm simply looking for someone who matches my current status. That's all.

00:52:44.016 --> 00:52:45.975
He doesn't need to be super impressive.

00:52:45.976 --> 00:52:48.060
Just someone of my capability,

00:52:48.061 --> 00:52:51.564
my means, and my beauty.

00:52:51.565 --> 00:52:53.274
Is that too much to ask?

00:52:53.275 --> 00:52:55.819
It's not like I'm looking to marry into the royal…

00:52:56.528 --> 00:52:57.529
family.

00:53:04.787 --> 00:53:06.163
Huh… :cue

00:53:27.017 --> 00:53:28.851
Didn't I warn you?

00:53:28.852 --> 00:53:29.895
Just look at this.

00:53:31.563 --> 00:53:33.232
I-AN, THE 21ST-CENTURY PRINCE SUYANG

00:53:37.528 --> 00:53:40.071
This is no time for doodling orchids.

00:53:40.072 --> 00:53:43.157
I told you wearing the cheollik was a bad idea.

00:53:43.158 --> 00:53:45.910
Didn't I beg you to wear proper court attire?

00:53:45.911 --> 00:53:48.037
The Royal Secretariat and Public Affairs Office

00:53:48.038 --> 00:53:49.748
are outraged right now.

00:53:51.375 --> 00:53:54.253
- And the public? - They're in an uproar.

00:53:54.753 --> 00:53:57.589
Is there any mention of the fire?

00:53:59.216 --> 00:54:00.217
Pardon?

00:54:02.177 --> 00:54:03.220
It appears my nickname

00:54:04.596 --> 00:54:05.889
will be trending once more.

00:54:07.683 --> 00:54:11.644
The regent Grand Prince I-AN has recently come under public scrutiny.

00:54:11.645 --> 00:54:12.812
Good morning.

00:54:12.813 --> 00:54:14.230
Ms. Do, look at this.

00:54:14.231 --> 00:54:16.357
The controversy stems from his appearance.

00:54:16.358 --> 00:54:19.068
- As the cheollik is considered informal… - Amazing, no?

00:54:19.069 --> 00:54:22.780
…many viewed it as inappropriate for a Grand Prince at a royal celebration.

00:54:22.781 --> 00:54:24.866
He looks so sharp in that.

00:54:24.867 --> 00:54:27.368
Members of the royal family have voiced criticism.

00:54:27.369 --> 00:54:30.913
They argue that preserving tradition and decorum is the duty of the crown,

00:54:30.914 --> 00:54:34.041
and that the Grand Prince's recent bizarre behavior is unacceptable.

00:54:34.042 --> 00:54:35.877
"Bizarre"? That's taking it too far.

00:54:35.878 --> 00:54:37.628
It's not like he was carrying a sword.

00:54:37.629 --> 00:54:41.382
Political circles praised him for putting practicality ahead of protocol

00:54:41.383 --> 00:54:43.259
and modeling a modern monarchy.

00:54:43.260 --> 00:54:45.136
Politicians always take Grand Prince I-AN's side.

00:54:45.137 --> 00:54:46.596
Why?

00:54:46.597 --> 00:54:50.142
Because the people are enamored with the Grand Prince.

00:54:50.726 --> 00:54:52.728
- He's so cool. - Let's get back to work.

00:54:53.270 --> 00:54:55.397
PRINCE I-AN IN CHEOLLIK AT ROYAL BIRTHDAY BANQUET

00:55:06.450 --> 00:55:08.784
Ah. His hype is next-level.

00:55:08.785 --> 00:55:10.953
-  What? -  Grand Prince I-AN.

00:55:10.954 --> 00:55:12.038
Right.

00:55:12.039 --> 00:55:14.082
The executive operations team is buzzing about it.

00:55:15.542 --> 00:55:16.543
Really?

00:55:18.712 --> 00:55:20.047
What do you think of him?

00:55:23.216 --> 00:55:26.219
PRINCE I-AN IN CHEOLLIK AT ROYAL BIRTHDAY BANQUET

00:55:26.887 --> 00:55:28.138
I think…

00:55:29.890 --> 00:55:31.224
he's quite nice.

00:55:31.975 --> 00:55:33.185
What?

00:55:58.460 --> 00:56:00.003
You told me not to pick them.

00:56:01.088 --> 00:56:02.338
Well, I mean,

00:56:02.339 --> 00:56:05.342
you mentioned that arranging flowers can quiet a restless mind.

00:56:15.435 --> 00:56:18.396
Why on earth are you remaining silent? You should defend yourself.

00:56:18.397 --> 00:56:20.981
Of course, it is true that you violated decorum. :cue

00:56:20.982 --> 00:56:22.567
Proper court attire was a must.

00:56:23.443 --> 00:56:24.527
But what can we do?

00:56:24.528 --> 00:56:26.529
You remain so enamored with the spotlight.

00:56:26.530 --> 00:56:28.197
But is that such a crime?

00:56:28.198 --> 00:56:31.575
Is it so wrong to want some attention in the 21st century?

00:56:31.576 --> 00:56:34.078
Let's be real. Court attire isn't the most flattering.

00:56:34.079 --> 00:56:36.247
The cheollik is so much cooler, isn't it?

00:56:36.248 --> 00:56:38.541
For one thing, court attire has such a drab palette.

00:56:38.542 --> 00:56:39.792
Such a grim brown.

00:56:39.793 --> 00:56:41.752
Sure, it might suit someone like me

00:56:41.753 --> 00:56:44.547
with a warm, golden complexion.

00:56:44.548 --> 00:56:47.591
I can pull off colors like that just fine.

00:56:47.592 --> 00:56:50.803
But on someone like Your Royal Highness, with that icy cool tone,

00:56:50.804 --> 00:56:52.179
it would just clash.

00:56:52.180 --> 00:56:54.140
Give me a break already.

00:56:54.141 --> 00:56:55.851
- That's enough. - "That's enough."

00:57:01.940 --> 00:57:04.233
- Tell them. - Tell them what?

00:57:04.234 --> 00:57:06.026
You meant no dishonor to His Majesty,

00:57:06.027 --> 00:57:08.613
and you were only expressing your simple, unassuming taste.

00:57:09.322 --> 00:57:10.948
Just issue that statement already.

00:57:10.949 --> 00:57:12.825
"Prince Suyang of the 21st-century"?

00:57:12.826 --> 00:57:14.453
How does that make any sense?

00:57:20.000 --> 00:57:21.084
Why not?

00:57:22.377 --> 00:57:23.670
You can't.

00:57:24.254 --> 00:57:26.172
- Why not? - Of course, you can't.

00:57:26.173 --> 00:57:27.466
Right.

00:57:29.593 --> 00:57:30.844
And why is that exactly?

00:57:34.514 --> 00:57:35.598
Are you drunk?

00:57:35.599 --> 00:57:37.016
No.

00:57:37.017 --> 00:57:38.809
Then what has gotten into you?

00:57:38.810 --> 00:57:41.855
How can you even think about marrying Prince I-AN?

00:57:42.731 --> 00:57:44.483
Ms. Do, just think about it.

00:57:45.108 --> 00:57:46.692
How many are as beautiful,

00:57:46.693 --> 00:57:48.569
as intelligent,

00:57:48.570 --> 00:57:50.822
and as wealthy as I am?

00:57:51.406 --> 00:57:54.241
Where else could you find such a match in this world?

00:57:56.495 --> 00:57:57.496
Okay.

00:57:58.288 --> 00:57:59.580
No one else knows, right?

00:57:59.581 --> 00:58:02.250
- You didn't tell anyone else, right? - You're the first.

00:58:03.376 --> 00:58:04.377
Good thinking.

00:58:05.128 --> 00:58:08.339
But I did submit a request for a royal audience.

00:58:08.340 --> 00:58:10.926
What? A royal audience request?

00:58:11.676 --> 00:58:13.720
Where? How?

00:58:15.347 --> 00:58:16.556
Royal audience requests?

00:58:17.057 --> 00:58:18.891
I guess you really are trending.

00:58:18.892 --> 00:58:20.726
The Prime Minister's Office reached out.

00:58:20.727 --> 00:58:22.770
Lord Jeongseon is begging for a meeting too.

00:58:22.771 --> 00:58:23.979
Lord Jeongseon too?

00:58:23.980 --> 00:58:28.275
He must be itching to chime in. You know how talkative he is.

00:58:28.276 --> 00:58:29.277
So nosy.

00:58:30.153 --> 00:58:31.320
Oh, right!

00:58:31.321 --> 00:58:34.282
Ms. Seong Huiju has also submitted a request. How shall I proceed?

00:58:34.866 --> 00:58:37.535
- Seong Huiju? - Yes, the CEO of Castle Beauty.

00:58:37.536 --> 00:58:39.204
The illegitimate-born of Castle Group.

00:58:43.458 --> 00:58:45.209
YOUR AUDIENCE REQUEST HAS BEEN REJECTED

00:58:45.210 --> 00:58:47.712
Why was it rejected? I haven't said a word yet.

00:58:48.547 --> 00:58:49.714
It's okay, Ms. Seong.

00:58:50.215 --> 00:58:52.216
An audience with Prince I-AN is no easy feat.

00:58:52.217 --> 00:58:53.759
And I'm easy?

00:58:53.760 --> 00:58:55.886
I'm an incredibly busy person too.

00:58:55.887 --> 00:58:57.763
Prince I-AN is currently a regent.

00:58:57.764 --> 00:58:59.515
He's basically the king.

00:58:59.516 --> 00:59:02.643
Plus, you said you didn't even write a reason for the request.

00:59:02.644 --> 00:59:05.020
What kind of king would give up his time for someone like that?

00:59:05.021 --> 00:59:06.272
Then what should I do?

00:59:06.273 --> 00:59:09.276
Should I have written, "I wish to marry you"?

00:59:10.068 --> 00:59:12.069
Stop talking about that damn marriage, okay?

00:59:12.070 --> 00:59:14.364
I feel like I'm about to get arrested any minute.

00:59:16.825 --> 00:59:17.909
Hold on.

00:59:21.746 --> 00:59:22.747
No way.

00:59:24.249 --> 00:59:25.624
Is he playing hard to get?

00:59:29.337 --> 00:59:31.798
He totally is. :cue

00:59:47.564 --> 00:59:49.608
Have we not heard from Grand Prince I-AN?

00:59:50.108 --> 00:59:52.359
No, both the Royal Secretariat

00:59:52.360 --> 00:59:54.863
and Lord Jeongseon are pressing him on the matter.

00:59:55.655 --> 00:59:58.491
But he has even turned down Prime Minister Min's audience request.

01:00:00.785 --> 01:00:03.663
Is this his way of saying he remains completely unfazed?

01:00:08.710 --> 01:00:11.421
You're practically climbing into that book at this rate.

01:00:14.549 --> 01:00:17.217
Why did you ask for this food?

01:00:17.218 --> 01:00:18.595
Did I do something wrong?

01:00:19.095 --> 01:00:20.180
You eat it.

01:00:23.934 --> 01:00:25.226
Seriously?

01:00:26.561 --> 01:00:28.688
I didn't know you cared for me so much.

01:00:29.648 --> 01:00:30.815
Thank you for the food.

01:00:32.817 --> 01:00:33.901
Mmm.

01:00:33.902 --> 01:00:36.862
Yes, eat that and stop talking.

01:00:36.863 --> 01:00:37.947
Huh?

01:00:37.948 --> 01:00:39.074
All your nagging

01:00:39.950 --> 01:00:41.660
is drowning out the sound of rain.

01:00:42.285 --> 01:00:43.286
Yes, sir.

01:00:46.122 --> 01:00:47.791
But this is important…

01:00:50.961 --> 01:00:53.921
Ms. Seong has submitted another request for a royal audience.

01:00:53.922 --> 01:00:55.464
How shall I respond this time?

01:00:55.465 --> 01:00:56.548
- Again? - Yes.

01:00:56.549 --> 01:00:58.717
I rejected it due to scheduling conflicts.

01:00:58.718 --> 01:01:00.761
But she submitted another request right away.

01:01:00.762 --> 01:01:02.722
With a different name, no less.

01:01:03.306 --> 01:01:04.848
What does that mean?

01:01:04.849 --> 01:01:09.311
The first request clearly stated, "Seong Huiju from Castle Beauty."

01:01:09.312 --> 01:01:13.483
This time, she put, "Castle Group Seong Hyeonguk's second daughter."

01:01:15.527 --> 01:01:16.610
Reject it.

01:01:16.611 --> 01:01:19.030
YOUR AUDIENCE REQUEST HAS BEEN REJECTED

01:01:21.032 --> 01:01:22.283
Again?

01:01:25.954 --> 01:01:28.123
Is he trying to get me riled up?

01:01:28.748 --> 01:01:29.833
Unbelievable.

01:01:31.084 --> 01:01:32.626
Have some.

01:01:32.627 --> 01:01:34.503
We all work to fill our bellies, don't we?

01:01:34.504 --> 01:01:35.839
Go on.

01:01:42.804 --> 01:01:43.805
What's this?

01:01:44.848 --> 01:01:46.391
- It's delicious. - Good, right?

01:01:47.308 --> 01:01:49.059
It just opened across the street.

01:01:49.060 --> 01:01:51.271
The whole team orders from there frequently.

01:01:51.771 --> 01:01:52.814
Hey.

01:01:53.356 --> 01:01:57.235
Tell them to share the treats they find instead of just gorging themselves!

01:01:58.653 --> 01:02:01.488
It'd be best if we didn't have to work so late.

01:02:01.489 --> 01:02:04.241
God, this is beyond infuriating.

01:02:04.242 --> 01:02:06.119
So what if he's a grand prince?

01:02:20.258 --> 01:02:22.469
Maybe it's because I didn't put down a reason?

01:02:36.066 --> 01:02:37.316
ROYAL AUDIENCE REQUEST

01:02:37.317 --> 01:02:39.276
Your Royal Highness,

01:02:39.277 --> 01:02:42.613
Castle Group, under the benevolent care of the Crown,

01:02:42.614 --> 01:02:45.866
has continued to achieve remarkable growth and development,

01:02:45.867 --> 01:02:48.078
attaining the honor of being the top conglomerate…

01:02:51.831 --> 01:02:54.125
Ah, is this a bit too much?

01:03:01.424 --> 01:03:05.761
I sincerely pledge to further the nation's development,

01:03:05.762 --> 01:03:08.472
and I hereby request an audience.

01:03:08.473 --> 01:03:10.891
I patiently await the sagacious counsel

01:03:10.892 --> 01:03:12.643
of Your Royal Highness.

01:03:12.644 --> 01:03:15.563
"Executive Director of Castle Group,

01:03:16.106 --> 01:03:19.234
Seong Huiju."

01:03:21.319 --> 01:03:22.654
SUBMIT

01:03:24.030 --> 01:03:25.490
YOUR REQUEST HAS BEEN SUBMITTED

01:03:26.199 --> 01:03:27.200
Ha!

01:03:29.744 --> 01:03:32.162
Seriously, what's gotten into her?

01:03:38.795 --> 01:03:41.213
Your Royal Highness, Ms. Seong…

01:03:41.214 --> 01:03:42.382
-  Reject it. - Yes, sir.

01:03:42.966 --> 01:03:44.800
- Your Royal Highness. - Reject it.

01:03:44.801 --> 01:03:45.802
Yes, sir.

01:03:46.678 --> 01:03:48.221
- Reject it. - Yes, sir.

01:03:49.055 --> 01:03:50.056
Got it.

01:03:50.849 --> 01:03:52.015
Ms. Seong--

01:03:52.016 --> 01:03:53.184
- Reject it! - Yes, sir!

01:03:56.396 --> 01:03:59.106
Ms. Seong continues to submit her requests.

01:03:59.107 --> 01:04:00.732
How much longer must I…

01:04:00.733 --> 01:04:02.360
REJECT IT

01:04:02.944 --> 01:04:04.736
- Your Royal Highness. - Reject it. :cue

01:04:04.737 --> 01:04:05.946
But wait--

01:04:05.947 --> 01:04:07.490
- Reject it! - Rejected.

01:04:13.329 --> 01:04:15.290
I reject your request for an audience.

01:04:21.671 --> 01:04:22.797
Oh, my goodness.

01:04:23.756 --> 01:04:26.467
Jeez, what's wrong with her?

01:04:33.850 --> 01:04:36.477
If you're gone in the count of three, I'll overlook it.

01:04:38.188 --> 01:04:39.439
Really?

01:04:42.358 --> 01:04:44.569
That much I can do for my junior alum.

01:05:03.504 --> 01:05:05.882
She has already submitted over five requests.

01:05:06.466 --> 01:05:07.966
With another new name this time?

01:05:07.967 --> 01:05:10.178
Yes, she put down "Junior alum" this time.

01:05:12.305 --> 01:05:13.723
- "Junior alum"? - Yes.

01:05:14.849 --> 01:05:18.268
She requests the esteemed counsel of her senior alum this time.

01:05:19.479 --> 01:05:22.273
What's this now? Are you two alumni?

01:05:25.109 --> 01:05:26.694
I assume it's another rejection?

01:05:27.445 --> 01:05:28.446
Grant it.

01:05:29.572 --> 01:05:30.739
Pardon?

01:05:30.740 --> 01:05:32.116
How can I say no

01:05:33.534 --> 01:05:34.702
to a junior alum in need?

01:05:43.253 --> 01:05:45.046
YOUR AUDIENCE REQUEST HAS BEEN ACCEPTED

01:05:51.761 --> 01:05:52.845
It worked.

01:06:39.726 --> 01:06:40.935
Who did you say was there?

01:06:41.519 --> 01:06:43.855
Executive Director Seong Huiju of Castle Group.

01:06:48.609 --> 01:06:51.445
You said you had a mole planted at his residence, right?

01:06:51.446 --> 01:06:53.739
- Yes, Your Majesty. - Can I trust her?

01:06:53.740 --> 01:06:56.701
Yes. You may call upon her at any time.

01:07:49.670 --> 01:07:51.172
I am not sure what to call you.

01:07:56.886 --> 01:07:58.137
You seem to go by many names.

01:07:58.930 --> 01:08:01.098
I was not sure which one you would prefer.

01:08:03.976 --> 01:08:05.353
Why did you seek me so earnestly?

01:08:21.369 --> 01:08:22.453
I wanted to propose.

01:08:28.292 --> 01:08:29.293
Let's…

01:08:31.212 --> 01:08:32.213
get married. :cue

01:08:59.449 --> 01:09:02.368
PERFECT CROWN

01:09:38.488 --> 01:09:39.780
Let's…

01:09:40.281 --> 01:09:41.490
get married.

01:09:41.491 --> 01:09:44.367
My pedigree is impressive, and my acumen sharper still.

01:09:44.368 --> 01:09:45.369
I decline.

01:09:46.162 --> 01:09:47.704
I was rejected.

01:09:47.705 --> 01:09:49.414
- I missed you. - Seong Huiju?

01:09:49.415 --> 01:09:50.665
Hyah!

01:09:50.666 --> 01:09:52.584
You dared to run a background check on me?

01:09:52.585 --> 01:09:54.044
- Yes. - "Yes"?

01:09:55.296 --> 01:09:56.881
I must meet this maiden.

01:09:58.257 --> 01:10:01.134
"Grand Prince I-AN's secret lover"?

01:10:01.135 --> 01:10:02.261
Me?

01:10:02.845 --> 01:10:05.555
- They're even speculating you're pregnant. -  What?

01:10:05.556 --> 01:10:09.352
You would marry me for nothing more than a hollow title?

01:10:14.899 --> 01:10:18.860
EPILOGUE

01:11:11.414 --> 01:11:13.833
And considering how easily you secured this approval,

01:11:14.750 --> 01:11:16.918
I guess it was only out of reach for me.

01:11:16.919 --> 01:11:19.714
So do not lecture me about demerit points or whatever.

01:11:30.182 --> 01:11:32.101
I'm so screwed.

01:11:34.145 --> 01:11:35.438
Am I going to get expelled?

01:11:36.480 --> 01:11:41.735
What if I end up in prison for insulting the royal family?

01:11:41.736 --> 01:11:43.529
Why on earth did I do that?

01:11:45.573 --> 01:11:47.449
Hey, get up.

01:11:47.450 --> 01:11:49.367
Hurry, get up. There's an announcement.

01:11:49.368 --> 01:11:50.952
What announcement?

01:11:50.953 --> 01:11:52.454
Get up. Hurry.

01:11:52.455 --> 01:11:54.372
It's total chaos. Everyone's freaking out.

01:11:54.373 --> 01:11:55.457
Why?

01:12:03.925 --> 01:12:05.676
As Confucius said,

01:12:06.260 --> 01:12:08.470
"Though a noble man does not contend with others,

01:12:08.471 --> 01:12:10.806
he must compete when it comes to archery."

01:12:13.351 --> 01:12:15.477
The forthcoming exhibition match

01:12:15.478 --> 01:12:16.854
celebrates that spirit.

01:12:18.022 --> 01:12:21.108
Thus, students shall devote themselves to their training.

01:12:21.901 --> 01:12:23.818
Well? Isn't this amazing?

01:12:23.819 --> 01:12:25.655
The range will be open for a whole month.

01:12:26.197 --> 01:12:28.240
You said you didn't have enough time to train.

01:12:30.868 --> 01:12:32.578
The sole condition for access

01:12:33.537 --> 01:12:34.580
shall be the observance

01:12:35.581 --> 01:12:37.333
of protocol and decorum.

01:12:47.218 --> 01:12:49.220
Translated by Justin S. Kim

01:13:00.523 --> 01:13:04.235
PERFECT CROWN

